# DataYee

DataYee is a Windows desktop application for force-curve data analysis.

## Install

```text
pip install DataYee
```

## Run

```text
datayee
```

The package supports Python 3.10 through 3.12. The included installer can
create a Conda environment and install the package in one step:

```text
python install.py datayee
```
